Hello fans of crazy soccer/football,

Another update has landed! It includes the following changes:

[list]
   [*]new languages implemented: Russian, German, French, Spanish and Chinese;
   [*]vanity items such as hats now look much better on player figures;
   [*]further improvements to the way legionnaires and abilities work; 
   [*]improved UI.
[/list]

